    "name": "StayEase API",
    "description": "Complete API collection for StayEase Hotel Booking Platform.\n\nBase URL: http://localhost:3000\n\nAll requests go through AuthService (API Gateway) which proxies to individual services.\n\nWorkflow:\n1. Signup → 2. Login → 3. Create Booking → 4. Create Payment Order → 5. Verify Payment → 6. Check Booking Status",
